quran[27]{c,v,t}:
  37,127,"But they denied him, so they will surely be presented (for punishment),"
  37,128,except the exclusively chosen (and purified) servants of Allah.
  37,129,And We left for him (an honourable mention) among the later generations.
  37,130,Peace be upon Ilyas (Elias)!
  37,131,"Indeed, this is how We reward the virtuously excellent."
  37,132,"Surely, he was among Our faithful servants."
  37,133,"And indeed, Lut (Lot) was among the messengers."
  37,134,"When We saved him and all of his family,"
  37,135,except an old woman among those who stayed behind.
  37,136,Then We destroyed the others.
  37,137,"And indeed, (O Meccans!) you pass by their ruins in the daylight,"
  37,138,and in the darkness of night (during your travels between Mecca and Syria). Do you not yet understand?
  37,139,"And indeed, Yunus (Jonah) was among the messengers,"
  37,140,when he fled to the overloaded ship.
  37,141,"So he joined (the other passengers) in drawing lots (to save the ship from sinking), but he was the one to be overthrown (into the sea)."
  37,142,"Then the whale swallowed him, and he was a self-condemning repentant."
  37,143,"If he had not been among those who glorify (Allah),"
  37,144,he would have surely remained in its belly till the day people will be resurrected.
  37,145,Then We cast him out upon the open shore while he was sick.
  37,146,And We caused a gourd plant to grow over him.
  37,147,"Then We sent him to (a city of) a hundred thousand people or more (i.e. Nineveh, in the land of Mosul),"
  37,148,"who then believed (in him). So, We granted them prosperity for a while."
  37,149,Ask them: ‘Are daughters to be for your Lord while sons are to be for them?
  37,150,Or did We create the angels as females while they were watching?’
  37,151,Indeed! It is one of their fabrications that they say:
  37,152,"‘Allah has children,’ and indeed, they are liars."
  37,153,Has He chosen daughters (for Himself) over sons?
